  "col_right L33: «Cortés» is printed with an acute over the e.",
  "col_right L35: the H of «Ḥabash» has its dot below.",
  "col_right L36, L37, L38, L45, L46: the guillemets are printed as small solid wedges, as on pp. 366, 370, 374, 377 and 381.",
